<description>&lt;p&gt;Two SPOs were found dead in Kishtwar, prompting condemnation by the J&amp;amp;K chief minister, while militants attacked a CRPF post in Kulgam, killing two terrorists and injuring three jawans. In Manipur, a woman farmer was killed and three men injured in a firing incident, and separate clashes between Kuki and Naga groups left one dead and three injured. The government announced confidence in holding elections in Manipur despite the violence, and a police reshuffle moved 136 DSPs to new assignments. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQV0U3WjVpSjRiSmtuQzFaYlk5V3lEdTBfcDlTOUhndC1STm8xMzJXZXFGeFExT3VsMWhYRlZqZWt6ZGJObHRJTjRPTTE5bmpnODlGc1hHc0xDYUdHSmx2VHhuUXgtci04MncyY016Z2RreG1oWV9Xc1NJUzBPeG9vbVNwSWF5QkhfTDlOT3N4emdybDVxUVpJcFFqSm12cmZIRFExS1RvdjdGeVV2SUNRenlB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQbFJXd3hDWVJsRzhPYXVJbEhRbHZ1YmZQUUNwUnRyaUFpQzBhVC01V0FsU3F3M21YLW9MbmpXQkd5bTI3bUk3aWlwaUk1dWdDc3c0eHlFMXZCRDlQbG1vNTZzVGI3XzNKNzdfZFlmSjhtSG9DNFVYbTRXVTN4Z1d1Tkg1a0M1R3FDVm9XZ25KQUN3aE1nS2hfRUN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOWEtobjJWVmhMTS04LVdwQzFnTmprZVY3RjNGNVNOVmItVGlLOWdPMHJtRERKd3hrQTIwM2JURXM0X2xhdXhDQV9xZDk2T1JGdUkwX1NBTFNLMlJIWFJIS0VUUVFQaTRoZVkxUWZ5bWZzdXpYcktPcWpPdW5qUG14T1F4Sm8yYUZtaXJJNFFsSHczdV9BME9fLVpWNi0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOZkwwWUhGSWtNV0k3ZTRKSl96ZDNNLVdGaFF2RUU1U2VDdUlGUnJBTFlMYnJKRj